ss=\"bullet\"> Click on the incorrect word </span><span class=\"bullet\">Type in the correct word to complete the sentence.</span>  <span class=\"bullet\"> Use capitals where necessary. <span/>"}]}]}, {"stimuli_ids": [], "template_override": 1, "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "id": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "id": 1}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}]}], "type": "RSLT", "id": 10, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": []}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Quiz"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}]}, {"stimuli_ids": [], "template_override": 1, "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "id": 0}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "pdf", "content": "engenn6le01ob01re7pdf01.pdf"}]}]}], "type": "DWS", "id": 11, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " Use superlatives to write about people you know or admire."}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Take Away"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment."}]}]}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn6le01ob01re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn6le01ob01re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn6le01ob01re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "1", "image": "engenn6le01ob01re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Ah \u2026 this is the best coffee with the smallest hint of cinnamon! I always have black coffee in the morning. I missed the coffee here. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I often drink tea ... you know that's the finest of British traditions. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: How is your family by the way? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Aunt Nelly is good, zany as ever. She's in a creative phase knitting and weaving.<br>"}, {"time": "26000", "image": "engenn6le01ob01re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Does she usually do crafts? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: She does from time to time.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: My sister sews once in a while. My niece and nephew are loud and usually run her ragged. She adores them.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: My house was hardly ever noisy. Mum, Dad and Teddy are all bookish and the quietest people I know. I'm the black sheep.<br>"}, {"time": "51000", "image": "engenn6le01ob01re2img06.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Black what?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Black sheep. The most different from the others. What about your family?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Mom is the sweetest person. She never gets upset or angry. I see her whenever I can. Dad is a bit grumpy once in a while. They both come from larger families so I have lots of cousins.<br>"}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "New Paths"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Just Coffee, Black"}, {"type": "position", "content": 1}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 1}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contents"}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. "}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "zany "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "eccentric; unconventional; unusual"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Aunt Nelly can be a bit zany at times. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le01ob01aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about family."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Superlatives"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use a superlative adjective to express the highest degree of a quality. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use a superlative adjective to talk about one thing or person in a group of things. You always use <span class=\"strong\"> the </span> with the superlative. <br>Superlatives can be regular or irregular. The structure of the regular superlative is:  <br> the + adjective-est <Br>  or <br>    the most adjective"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjective\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Superlative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Regular\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"fine <br>quiet <br>small <br>different <br>intelligent\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the finest <br>the quietest <br>the smallest <Br>the most different <br>the most <br>intelligent\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Irregular\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"good <br>bad\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the best <br>the worst\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "This is the best coffee!"}, {"type": "example", "content": "She is the most intelligent person in the family."}, {"type": "example", "content": "The MOMA houses some of the finest art in the world."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Rainy weather is the worst."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Habits and Routines"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you talk about someone's habits and routines, you use the Simple Present tense and frequency words."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use expressions of frequency to say how many times you do an activity. <br> This can be an adverb like<span class=\"italic\"> often, sometimes</span>   or <span class=\"italic\">never</span>. It can also be expression like <span class=\"italic\">a lot, all the time</span> or <span class=\"italic\">when I can</span>."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":8,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adverbs\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Expressions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"always\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"every day/week/month\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"usually\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"most of the time\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"often\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"every other day/week/month\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"sometimes\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"once in a while\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"occasionally\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"from time to time\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"hardly ever\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"when ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"never\\\"}\",\"\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I always have black coffee in the morning."}, {"type": "example", "content": "My house was hardly ever noisy. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I go to the movies once in a while."}, {"type": "example", "content": "My brother works every other day."}, {"type": "example", "content": "My teacher occasionally asks to check out homework."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to knit"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to use long needles to make a sweater or scarf"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Do you know how to knit?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le01ob01aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to weave"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to make fabric on a loom"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I want to learn how to weave next year. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le01ob01aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "niece"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "my sister or brother's daughter "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My sister's daughter, my niece Alison, is 2 today."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le01ob01aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "nephew"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "my sister or brother's son"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My sister's son, my nephew Greg, is at university now."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le01ob01aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to run ragged"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to keep someone very busy"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My sister's children run her ragged! "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le01ob01aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "bookish "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "always reading a book "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My family are all bookish. They are always reading something! "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le01ob01aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "black sheep "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the rebel of the family; different from the others"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I am the black sheep of my family. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le01ob01aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "grumpy"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "cranky; irritable"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He's always grumpy when he's hungry or tired. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le01ob01aud09"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le01ob01re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Find adjective to describe some people you know or admire."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use the adjective in the superlative form."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Say what actions the people do to makes you see them this way."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write 70 to 90 words."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your sentence aloud to a partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I look up and use adjectives."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use the superlative."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about people I know or admire."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read my sentences aloud."}]}]}